'''Restriction Stages''' are a type of level introduced in the [[Version 5.7 Update]]. As their name suggests, these stages contain '''restrictions''' (also known as '''Battle Restrictions''') which limit the [[Cat Units]] that can be used or reduce the Cat Deploy Limit. When viewing a Restriction Stage on the map, the word "<font color="d48ed0">Conditions</font>" will appear under the level name and there will be a magenta "Conditions" button that can be tapped on to see the restrictions.

Cats that don't meet a stage's restriction can still be included in a player's lineup and activate [[Cat Combo]]s, but their icons will have a red tint and trying to deploy them will cause the text "<font color="EED202">This unit cannot be deployed!</font>" to appear on screen.

There are 5 different types of restrictions:
*'''Rarity Restrictions''' only allow Cats of certain rarities.
*'''Max # of Deployable Cats''' changes the Cat Deploy Limit.
*'''Cat Deploy Cost''' makes you unable to spawn Cats above or below a certain cost.
*'''Deploy from Row 1 only''' prevents spawning of any Cats in Row 2.
*'''Unit Restrictions''' either prevent spawning of specific Cats or only allow specific cats.

For a list of all Restriction stages, see the [[:Category:Restriction Stages|Restriction Stages]] category.

