==Trivia==
*[[Black Hole (Cats of the Cosmos)|Black Hole]], [[Dogsville Annex (Merciless)|Dogsville Annex]] and the {{4c}} versions of [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event#Merc Storia: Mystery|Merc Storia: Mystery]]'s stages are currently the only stages to have two different restrictions.
*Prior to [[Version 8.5 Update|version 8.5]], [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cats]] were not usable on any stage with a Rarity Restriction.
*The [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stages]] [[Babies First (Merciless)|Babies First]] and [[The Devil's Rhythm (Merciless)|The Devil's Rhythm]] are the only Restriction Stages to allow [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] but not Legend Rare Cats.
*Even though the [[Ototo Corps#Iron Wall|Iron Wall Cat]] normally counts toward the Cat Deploy Limit, it can still be used when the max number of units is reached in stages with the Max # of Deployable Cats restriction.

